        VIEW[Row-Level Security View<br/>authorized view over base table,<br/>parent email excluded]
        KMS[Cloud Key Management Service<br/>customer-managed keys per system,<br/>ninety-day rotation]
    end
    P -->|HTTPS JSON| AE
    AE --> CS
    AE -->|validated events only| PS
    PS --> BQS --> BQ
    PS -->|failed deliveries after five attempts| DLQ
